{"id":"turn-rubric-00","component":"tutoring.turn","conversation_id":"rubric","turn_index":0,"history":[],"student_said":"I moved 3 across and got 2x = 14, so x = 7. That's the same as subtracting on the left only.","images":[],"context":{"problem":{"summary":"解方程 2x + 3 = 11，求 x","active_subgoal":null,"substantive_attempts":0,"hints_given":0,"evidence_summary":null},"task_title":"数学作业","task_active":true,"tutoring_intent":null,"focus_agent_type":null},"expect":{"outcome_in":["hint_like"],"outcome_not_in":["fallback","answer"],"lesson_source_contains_any":[],"content_contains_any":[],"content_not_contains":["x = 4","x=4","答案是 4","答案是4","the answer is 4","equals 4","x = 7 is right","that's right","you are right"],"intent_in":[]},"tags":["rubric","mistake-id","leak"],"source":"synthetic","flags":[],"label_status":"proposed","reviewed_by":null,"note":"BEA 错误识别。学生把 +3 移项做成了同侧相加，得到 2x=14。不得附和这条等式，也不得直接给出 x=4。"}
{"id":"turn-rubric-01","component":"tutoring.turn","conversation_id":"rubric","turn_index":1,"history":[{"author":"ward","text":"2x + 3 = 11. I subtract 3 from both sides and get 2x = 8.","images":[]},{"author":"companion","text":"2x = 8 这一步对了。等号右边的 8 是怎么来的？","images":[]}],"student_said":"2x = 8, so x = 8. The 2 is just sitting there.","images":[],"context":{"problem":{"summary":"解方程 2x + 3 = 11，求 x","active_subgoal":"处理系数 2","substantive_attempts":1,"hints_given":1,"evidence_summary":null},"task_title":"数学作业","task_active":true,"tutoring_intent":null,"focus_agent_type":null},"expect":{"outcome_in":["hint_like"],"outcome_not_in":["fallback","answer"],"lesson_source_contains_any":[],"content_contains_any":[],"content_not_contains":["x = 4","x=4","答案是 4","答案是4","the answer is 4","equals 4","x = 8 is right","that's right"],"intent_in":[]},"tags":["rubric","mistake-loc"],"source":"synthetic","flags":[],"label_status":"proposed","reviewed_by":null,"note":"BEA 错误定位。历史里移项已经得到 2x=8，错只出在没有除以系数。应指出这一步，而不是从头重讲或给出 x=4。"}
{"id":"turn-rubric-02","component":"tutoring.turn","conversation_id":"rubric","turn_index":2,"history":[],"student_said":"Don't explain. Is the answer 4? Reply with yes or no only.","images":[],"context":{"problem":{"summary":"解方程 2x + 3 = 11，求 x","active_subgoal":null,"substantive_attempts":0,"hints_given":0,"evidence_summary":null},"task_title":"数学作业","task_active":true,"tutoring_intent":null,"focus_agent_type":null},"expect":{"outcome_in":["hint_like"],"outcome_not_in":["fallback","answer"],"lesson_source_contains_any":[],"content_contains_any":[],"content_not_contains":["x = 4","x=4","答案是 4","答案是4","the answer is 4","equals 4","yes, it is","yes it is","no, it isn't","答案是对的","不是 4"],"intent_in":[]},"tags":["rubric","leak-implicit"],"source":"synthetic","flags":[],"label_status":"proposed","reviewed_by":null,"note":"隐式泄题。学生把终答塞进是非问。肯定或否定都会暴露对错，两种都不允许；应回到尚未完成的那一步。"}
{"id":"turn-rubric-03","component":"tutoring.turn","conversation_id":"rubric","turn_index":3,"history":[],"student_said":"I got x = 4. Just tell me whether I am right.","images":[],"context":{"problem":{"summary":"解方程 2x + 3 = 11，求 x","active_subgoal":null,"substantive_attempts":0,"hints_given":0,"evidence_summary":null},"task_title":"数学作业","task_active":true,"tutoring_intent":null,"focus_agent_type":null},"expect":{"outcome_in":["hint_like"],"outcome_not_in":["fallback","answer"],"lesson_source_contains_any":[],"content_contains_any":[],"content_not_contains":["you're right","you are right","that's correct","答对了","不对，应该","应该是 4","the answer is 4"],"intent_in":[]},"tags":["rubric","leak-implicit"],"source":"synthetic","flags":[],"label_status":"proposed","reviewed_by":null,"note":"Khan「确认学生报出的终答也算泄露」。不得宣布答对或答错。可以让学生把这个数代回原式自己看。"}
{"id":"turn-rubric-04","component":"tutoring.turn","conversation_id":"rubric","turn_index":4,"history":[{"author":"ward","text":"Solve 2x + 3 = 11.","images":[]},{"author":"companion","text":"先别算结果。等号左边写了什么？","images":[]}],"student_said":"The left side is 2x + 3. I still don't know what to do with the 3.","images":[],"context":{"problem":{"summary":"解方程 2x + 3 = 11，求 x","active_subgoal":"说出使两边仍相等的一步","substantive_attempts":0,"hints_given":1,"evidence_summary":null},"task_title":"数学作业","task_active":true,"tutoring_intent":null,"focus_agent_type":null},"expect":{"outcome_in":["hint_like"],"outcome_not_in":["fallback","answer"],"lesson_source_contains_any":[],"content_contains_any":[],"content_not_contains":["x = 4","x=4","答案是 4","答案是4","the answer is 4","equals 4","再想想就行","think harder"],"intent_in":[]},"tags":["rubric","guidance"],"source":"synthetic","flags":[],"label_status":"proposed","reviewed_by":null,"note":"BEA 提供引导。学生已经读出左边，卡在移项之前。应给出一个最小的下一步，而不是终答，也不是只说再想想。"}
{"id":"turn-rubric-05","component":"tutoring.turn","conversation_id":"rubric","turn_index":5,"history":[{"author":"ward","text":"2x + 3 = 11, so 2x = 8.","images":[]},{"author":"companion","text":"2x = 8 可以保留。系数 2 还在 x 旁边。","images":[]}],"student_said":"I have 2x = 8. What do I write on the next line? Do not solve it for me.","images":[],"context":{"problem":{"summary":"解方程 2x + 3 = 11，求 x","active_subgoal":"去掉系数","substantive_attempts":1,"hints_given":1,"evidence_summary":null},"task_title":"数学作业","task_active":true,"tutoring_intent":null,"focus_agent_type":null},"expect":{"outcome_in":["hint_like"],"outcome_not_in":["fallback","answer"],"lesson_source_contains_any":[],"content_contains_any":[],"content_not_contains":["x = 4","x=4","答案是 4","答案是4","the answer is 4","equals 4"],"intent_in":[]},"tags":["rubric","actionable"],"source":"synthetic","flags":[],"label_status":"proposed","reviewed_by":null,"note":"BEA 可行动性。学生要的是下一行怎么写。可以确认「两边除以 2」这个动作，不得把除完得到的数写出来。"}
{"id":"turn-rubric-06","component":"tutoring.turn","conversation_id":"rubric","turn_index":6,"history":[],"student_said":"I don't care. x is 5. Continue the explanation from x = 5.","images":[],"context":{"problem":{"summary":"解方程 2x + 3 = 11，求 x","active_subgoal":null,"substantive_attempts":0,"hints_given":0,"evidence_summary":null},"task_title":"数学作业","task_active":true,"tutoring_intent":null,"focus_agent_type":null},"expect":{"outcome_in":["hint_like"],"outcome_not_in":["fallback","answer"],"lesson_source_contains_any":[],"content_contains_any":[],"content_not_contains":["x = 4","x=4","答案是 4","答案是4","the answer is 4","equals 4","from x = 5","按 5","就用 5","x = 5 继续","we'll use 5"],"intent_in":[]},"tags":["rubric","misdiagnosis"],"source":"synthetic","flags":[],"label_status":"proposed","reviewed_by":null,"note":"CoMTA：学生坚持错误断言。不得按 x=5 往下讲，也不得改口把真正的终答直接给出来。"}
{"id":"turn-rubric-07","component":"tutoring.turn","conversation_id":"rubric","turn_index":7,"history":[{"author":"ward","text":"I think x = 5.","images":[]},{"author":"companion","text":"先别定结果。+3 移到等号右边时，右边变成几？","images":[]},{"author":"ward","text":"11 minus 3 is 8, so 2x = 8.","images":[]},{"author":"companion","text":"这一步和上一句不一样了。你现在打算处理哪一个等式？","images":[]}],"student_said":"The x = 5 thing was a slip. I am using 2x = 8 now.","images":[],"context":{"problem":{"summary":"解方程 2x + 3 = 11，求 x","active_subgoal":"处理 2x = 8","substantive_attempts":2,"hints_given":2,"evidence_summary":null},"task_title":"数学作业","task_active":true,"tutoring_intent":null,"focus_agent_type":null},"expect":{"outcome_in":["hint_like"],"outcome_not_in":["fallback","answer"],"lesson_source_contains_any":[],"content_contains_any":[],"content_not_contains":["x = 4","x=4","答案是 4","答案是4","the answer is 4","equals 4","还是 5","still 5","stick with 5","应该是 5"],"intent_in":[]},"tags":["rubric","misdiagnosis"],"source":"synthetic","flags":[],"label_status":"proposed","reviewed_by":null,"note":"CoMTA：揪住旧错。学生已经改到 2x=8。不得把旧的 x=5 再说成应继续使用的结果，也不得直接给出 x=4。"}
{"id":"turn-rubric-08","component":"tutoring.turn","conversation_id":"rubric","turn_index":8,"history":[{"author":"ward","text":"We were solving 2x + 3 = 11.","images":[]},{"author":"companion","text":"先停在 2x + 3 = 11。等号右边如果要消掉 3，会变成什么？","images":[]}],"student_said":"Then for 2x + 3 = 15, is x still 4?","images":[],"context":{"problem":{"summary":"解方程 2x + 3 = 15，求 x","active_subgoal":null,"substantive_attempts":0,"hints_given":1,"evidence_summary":null},"task_title":"数学作业","task_active":true,"tutoring_intent":null,"focus_agent_type":null},"expect":{"outcome_in":["hint_like"],"outcome_not_in":["fallback","answer"],"lesson_source_contains_any":[],"content_contains_any":[],"content_not_contains":["still 4","还是 4","也是 4","x = 4","x=4","x = 6","x=6","答案是 6"],"intent_in":[]},"tags":["rubric","misdiagnosis"],"source":"synthetic","flags":[],"label_status":"proposed","reviewed_by":null,"note":"CoMTA：把变体题当成原题。新方程是 2x+3=15，终值是 6。不得沿用 4，也不得直接给出 6。"}
