{"id":"turn-rubric-13","component":"tutoring.turn","conversation_id":"rubric","turn_index":13,"history":[],"student_said":"2 is prime and 4 is not, so every even number after 2 is not prime. 9 is odd, so 9 is prime. Right?","images":[],"context":{"problem":{"summary":"判断：9 是质数。对还是错","active_subgoal":"用约数检验 9，而不是用奇偶","substantive_attempts":0,"hints_given":0,"evidence_summary":null},"task_title":"数学作业","task_active":true,"tutoring_intent":null,"focus_agent_type":null},"expect":{"outcome_in":["hint_like"],"outcome_not_in":["fallback","answer"],"lesson_source_contains_any":[],"content_contains_any":[],"content_not_contains":["9 is not prime","9 isn't prime","9 不是质数","不是质数","not a prime"],"intent_in":[]},"tags":["rubric","socratic","mistake-id"],"source":"synthetic","flags":[],"label_status":"proposed","reviewed_by":null,"note":"归纳阶段。学生从「偶数不是质数」跳到「奇数就是质数」。应接住这个跳跃，不得直接宣布 9 不是质数。"}
